OL,3,GNEWSAOutdoor pools see rise in visitors
OL,4,Athis summer
OL,5,
OL,6,FOutdoor swimming pools and lidos have
OL,7,Freported increased visitor numbers this
OL,8,Fsummer, with some venues recording
OL,9,Ftheir busiest season in years.
OL,11,FBovey Tracey Pool in Devon said demand
OL,12,Fincreased by 20% to 25% this year,
OL,13,Fwhile Plymouth's Tinside Lido welcomed
OL,14,F60,000 visitors by the end of July,
OL,15,Fsurpassing its previous 21st-century
OL,16,Fseasonal record.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
