OL,3,GNEWSAOutdoor pools see rise in visitors
OL,4,Athis summer
OL,5,
OL,6,FBude Sea Pool in Cornwall said it
OL,7,Freached maximum capacity on more days
OL,8,Fthan previously, while Mount Wise Pools
OL,9,Fin Plymouth recorded a 17.6% increase
OL,10,Fin visitors compared with the same
OL,11,Fperiod last year.
OL,13,FThe venues said the warm, dry weather
OL,14,Fand heatwaves encouraged more people to
OL,15,Fswim and take part in outdoor
OL,16,Factivities.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
